                "project": "qt-nfv-recovering-center",
                "logstore": "stability-locate-event",
                "indexHint": "双级 SLS 入口的第二级：Transit Worker 从上游告警事件源转写到此，主 Consumer 从此消费。上游有、此处无 => 停在 Transit；此处有、无业务对象 => 停在主 Consumer"
